<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Graph Generation with Spectral Geodesic Flow Matching" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Geodesics and the conditional vector field</span></a></li>
