<p id="A4.F3.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.F3.2.1" class="ltx_text"><img src="2510.02520v1/figures/ego-samples.png" id="A4.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/183;" width="476" height="183" alt="Refer to caption"></span></p>
